nverts those scores into the normalized attention matrix </span><code>A</co=
de><span> that we discussed in the previous section</span></p></li><li><p><=
code>A</code><span> is applied to </span><code>V</code><span> to produce th=
e output matrix </span><code>Z</code></p></li></ul><p><span>Note that the a=
ttention matrix is not a separate hand-written object. It emerges from </sp=
an><code>Q</code><span>, </span><code>K</code><span>, and softmax.</span></=
