h></svg></button></div></div></h2><p>In sliding-window attention, the curre=
nt token does not attend to the full prefix but only to a fixed local windo=
w. This is the same broad idea behind DeepSeek Sparse Attention, where each=
 token also only attends to a subset of previous tokens.</p><p>However, the=
 selected tokens are not determined by a fixed-width local window. Instead,=
 DeepSeek Sparse Attention uses a learned sparse pattern. In short, it uses=
