Linear keeps the same broad transformer skeleton and the same 3:1 pattern, =
but it changes both halves of the recipe.</p><p>On the lightweight side, Ki=
mi Delta Attention is a refinement of Gated DeltaNet. Where Qwen3-Next uses=
