ing, which gives finer control over the memory update. On the heavier side,=
 Kimi replaces Qwen3-Next=E2=80=99s gated-attention layers with gated MLA l=
ayers.</p><p>So, it=E2=80=99s still the same broader pattern as in Qwen3-Ne=
xt and Qwen3.5, but both ingredients (slightly) change. I.e., most layers a=
re still handled by a cheaper linear-style mechanism, and periodic heavier =
layers still remain for stronger retrieval.</p><div class=3D"captioned-imag=
